<header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HUMAN GOLD RUSH LESSON</p><h1>Discord Gracebook</h1><p class="intro">Discord Gracebook is the active conversation and organizing space behind the public LLB community center.</p><blockquote>How can a community continue learning between gatherings without turning conversation into surveillance?</blockquote><div class="actions"><a href="{{discord_invite}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join Discord Gracebook<span>→</span></a><a href="#guidelines">Read Community Agreements<span>→</span></a></div></header><section class="content-grid"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>A living notebook</h2><p>Use Gracebook for lesson discussions, event preparation, local circles, questions, stories, and community support.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>Operational events only</h2><p>The research system may record consented actions such as joining a circle, opening a lesson, or responding to an invitation. Ordinary message content is excluded by default.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>Community agreements</h2><p>Consent, dignity, no pressure, accurate YAM-is-ON disclosures, nonfinancial Seeking Gratitude, honest outcomes, privacy, and the right to step away.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h2>Human gathering first</h2><p>Online activity should support local relationships and LAUGH events rather than replace them.</p></div></article></section><section class="media-section"><div class="section-heading"><p>MEDIA FOR THIS LESSON</p><h2>Watch, listen, and discuss</h2></div><div class="media-grid"><article class="media-card video"><div class="media-frame"><span>▶</span><small>VIDEO 1</small></div><h3>Discord Gracebook: orientation</h3><p>Reserved for the featured story or introductory video.</p><a href="#">Transcript coming soon</a></article><article class="media-card video"><div class="media-frame"><span>▶</span><small>VIDEO 2</small></div><h3>Community conversation</h3><p>Reserved for a demonstration, conversation, or local example.</p><a href="#">Discussion guide coming soon</a></article><article class="media-card podcast"><div class="media-frame"><span>◉</span><small>PODCAST</small></div><h3>Listen and reflect</h3><p>Reserved for the facilitator or community podcast episode.</p><a href="#">Transcript coming soon</a></article></div></section>
